      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed, I dont know what happened in the last year of vrchat but i use to be able to join a 30 plus people instance and not lag like crazy.  Within the last 2 years,  that same card could barely handle 10 people in an instance and vrc would freeze for a second whenever anyone would load in.  However,  i did find that if you turned off logging in the debug menu, the freezing went down significantly.  But all in all, i upgraded to a new pc just to be able to handle 30 people instances again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
