      "value": "@{617f5b4a134fd1219204d95e|full_name} > Within the last 2 years, [...] vrc would freeze for a second whenever anyone would load in.\n\nVRC [Light Volumes](https://www.poiyomi.com/shading/light-data#light-volumes) by RED_SIM are known to cause a performance impact / stutter on avatar load (since May 18, 2025). It's only going to get more frequent as creators update their avatars to the latest Poiyomi Toon versions, and leave Light Volumes support enabled by default. (lilToon is not immune to this either.)\n\nYou can (mostly) mitigate the worst offenders by blocking unoptimized avatars (Poor and Below, or Very Poor) in your settings.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
