      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df2b5b8d247254d480bde9|full_name} VRChat is actually quite optimized for an Unity application. The #1 reason for performance degradation is (unoptimized/poorly optimized) user-created avatars (and worlds, to an extent). That said, works on my machine (and I use an optimized, Good performance rated avatar on all platforms).\n\nIn this \"bug report\", there are no debug output logs, no steps to reproduce the issue, no discussion points on what needs to be improved or what's broken, only complaints that lead to nowhere.\n\nTupper also isn't a developer, but Head of Community.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
