      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Closing, not a bug report. There has not been a reduction of average framerate across users (it's pretty steady recently), so there does not appear to be a bug.\n\nPlease employ our performance systems to control user content and its impact on your performance!\n\nSome (very general) advice:\n\n- Avatars: Reduce \"Uncompressed Size\" limit to 150MB or lower, reduce download size limit to 300MB, block Very Poor by default\n\n- Graphics: Turn off anti-aliasing, reduce mirror resolution\n\n- Safety: Turn off animators for everyone except friends\n\n- SteamVR: Reduce render resolution to 100% or lower\n\n- Close external programs, avoid having too many tabs open, restart your PC regularly, ensure all drivers and OS are up to date",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
